B.a9z=new A.c9(B.mD,["future-urban-mobility","The Future of Urban Mobility in Kenya","Technology","5 min read","assets/images/future-urban-mobility.jpg","How Cabi is transforming the way Nairobi moves with decentralized ride-hailing, electric bodas, and fair driver revenue sharing.","Fees charged are not for corporate enrichment, but are actively recycled into Cabi Legacy equity and driver vehicle ownership.","Cabi Operations Team"],t.li)
B.a9A=new A.c9(B.mD,["the-road-to-dignity-why-drivers-choose-cabi","The Road to Dignity: Why Drivers Choose Cabi","Community","3 min read","assets/images/driver-economic-growth.jpg","A candid look at how reusable commissions and Cabi Legacy programs turn daily miles into real asset ownership and long-term security.",'"For the first time in five years of driving, I am not just surviving day-to-day. My daily trips now contribute automatically to my Cabi Legacy fund." \u2014 Samuel M., Driver Partner',"Cabi Editorial Desk"],t.li)
B.a9y=new A.c9(B.mD,["the-sacred-promise-of-every-journey-safety-first","The Sacred Promise of Every Journey: Safety First","Safety & Trust","4 min read","assets/images/digital-trust-safety.jpg","Safety is the unspoken promise that you will return home. Mandatory 4-digit start PINs and rejecting offline trips protect both passengers and drivers.",'Never accept the "Offline Deal" (Hapa Kando). The moment you cancel, the entire safety net collapses. A few saved shillings are never worth your life.',"Cabi Safety Advisory Council"],t.li)
B.a9x=new A.c9(B.mD,["the-power-of-warmth-courtesy-and-tipping","The Power of Warmth: Courtesy and Tipping","Community & Culture","3 min read","assets/images/kindness-courtesy-tipping.jpg","A vehicle or boda is a shared human sanctuary. How a kind greeting, patience in traffic, and 100% direct driver tips create solidarity across our cities.","100% of every tip goes directly to the driver with 0% platform deductions. Every shilling settles immediately into their mobile money wallet.","Grace W., Community Lead"],t.li)
